      12.0
    ],
    "can_rescore_ladders_under_tail90_without_solving": false,
    "why": "grid_convergence_gbm.run_ladder() builds e_unit_by_key in memory (line 477/560) and returns it (line 615) but never writes it; the JSONL rung records carry only mean / median / p01 / p99 / max plus a sum+first fingerprint. grid_convergence_breast.py is the same. A tail mean is not recoverable from those five order statistics, so tail90 cannot be evaluated at any rung except dx = 12 um without re-running the transport solves."
  }
